{"ticker":"SWK","updated":"2026-10-24T00:14:28Z","profile":{"longName":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.","shortName":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Tools & Accessories","country":"United States","website":"https://www.stanleyblackanddecker.com","fullTimeEmployees":41000,"marketCap":14986891264,"trailingPE":24.264057,"forwardPE":15.734399,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.9828952,"pegRatio":1.39,"targetMeanPrice":100.0,"targetHighPrice":109.0,"targetLowPrice":90.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.004,"earningsGrowth":2.478,"grossMargins":0.32213002,"operatingMargins":0.08443,"profitMargins":0.040689997,"totalRevenue":15247699968,"beta":1.17,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":104.68,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":61.9,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.4},"summary":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. provides hand tools, power tools, outdoor products, and related accessories in the United States, Canada, Other Americas, Europe, and Asia. Its Tools & Outdoor segment offers professional grade corded and cordless electric power tools and equipment, including drills, impact wrenches and drivers, grinders, saws, routers, concrete prep and placement tools, and sanders; pneumatic tools and fasteners; corded and cordless electric power tools; household power tools, hand-held vacuums, and small appliances; leveling and layout tools, planes, hammers, demolition tools, clamps, vises, knives, saws, chisels, and industrial and automotive tools; drill, screwdriver, router bits, abrasives, saw blades, and threading products; tool boxes, sawhorses, medical cabinets, and engineered storage solutions; and electric and gas-powered lawn and garden products. This segment sells its products under the DEWALT, CRAFTSMAN, CUB CADET, STANLEY, BLACK+DECKER, and HUSTLER brands through retailers, third-party distributors, independent dealers, and a direct sales force. Its Industrial segment provides threaded fasteners, blind rivets and tools, blind inserts and tools, drawn arc weld studs and systems, engineered plastic and mechanical fasteners, self-piercing riveting systems, precision nut running systems, micro fasteners, high-strength structural fasteners, axel swage, lat","summary_zh":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. 在美國、加拿大、其他美洲、歐洲和亞洲提供手動工具、電動工具、戶外產品和相關配件。其工具和戶外部門提供專業級有線和無線電動工具和設備，包括鑽頭、衝擊扳手和起子、磨床、鋸、刳刨機、混凝土準備和澆築工具以及打磨機；氣動工具和緊固件；有線和無線電動工具；家用電動工具、手持式吸塵器和小家電；調平和佈局工具、刨刀、錘子、拆卸工具、夾子、虎鉗、刀、鋸、鑿子以及工業和汽車工具；鑽頭、螺絲起子、銑刀、磨料、鋸片和螺紋產品；工具箱、鋸木架、醫療櫃和工程儲存解決方案；以及電動和燃氣驅動的草坪和花園產品。該部門透過零售商、第三方經銷商、獨立經銷商和直銷隊伍以 DEWALT、CRAFTSMAN、CUB CADET、STANLEY、BLACK+DECKER 和 HUSTLER 品牌銷售其產品。其工業部門提供螺紋緊固件、盲鉚釘和工具、盲鑲件和工具、拉弧焊螺柱和系統、工程塑料和機械緊固件、自衝鉚接系統、精密螺母運行系統、微型緊固件、高強度結構緊固件、軸模、拉桿","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"工具及配件","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":77.04,"h":77.62,"l":76.42,"c":76.47,"v":2191400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":76.46,"h":76.94,"l":74.93,"c":75.19,"v":2674300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":74.76,"h":76.04,"l":74.48,"c":75.74,"v":1816800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":76.2,"h":76.44,"l":74.33,"c":75.3,"v":1742000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":75.13,"h":76.11,"l":73.85,"c":74.29,"v":2325500},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.08,"h":72.64,"l":71.28,"c":71.72,"v":1738500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":72.45,"h":73.77,"l":72.08,"c":72.85,"v":1933900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":73.29,"h":74.82,"l":72.75,"c":74.74,"v":1630500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":75.61,"h":78.43,"l":75.61,"c":78.42,"v":3181100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":78.51,"h":78.98,"l":77.16,"c":78.42,"v":3113300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":77.84,"h":78.11,"l":76.34,"c":76.74,"v":2338800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":76.68,"h":77.59,"l":76.06,"c":76.97,"v":1677800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":77.34,"h":80.06,"l":76.61,"c":79.52,"v":2001000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":78.92,"h":79.27,"l":76.68,"c":77.57,"v":2757500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":77.96,"h":78.86,"l":77.35,"c":78.56,"v":1755400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":78.8,"h":79.42,"l":77.35,"c":77.81,"v":1753600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":78.29,"h":81.44,"l":77.52,"c":78.18,"v":2280000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":78